{{{{{1<noinclude>|Tip data</noinclude>}}}|Uncancellable windup|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|type         = Buzzword
|link         = Basic attack#Uncancellable Windup
|image        = Relentless Force 2.png
|description  = Some effects cause a basic attack to have an '''uncancellable windup'''. Unlike normal basic attacks and similar to the cast time of a spell, the windup of these attacks cannot be {{tip|interrupt|interrupted}} by neither the user themselves nor any status effect, other than {{tip|death}}, {{tip|polymorph}}, {{cai|E|Quinn}}, {{iis|Hextech Rocketbelt}} {{nie|Supersonic}}, and in some cases, {{tip|untargetability}} and range.
|description2 = Any effect that would disrupt an attack's windup, aside from the ones noted above, are ignored by basic attacks with '''uncancellable windups'''. If the attack doesn't lock out other abilities, they may be used normally, and the basic attack will hit during the ability cast.
}}
